# Résumé project: what a helper may see.
# Allow-list: everything at the root is ignored, then only the lines with "!" come back.
# A new folder stays private until someone adds a "!" line for it here.
# Check before the first commit: sh scripts/preview_share.sh

/*

# --- shared: these folders and files, nothing else ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/DATA_REFERENCES/
!/FINAL_RESUMES/
!/INTERVIEW_PREP/
!/STRATEGIC_PITCH/
!/project_review_2026-10-25_second-pass-check/
!/scripts/
!/tests/

# --- add later if wanted: remove the "#" (both hold only the plan workflow today) ---
# !/CLAUDE.md
# !/GEMINI.md

# --- never shared, even inside a shared folder ---
# automatic edit backups (name_vX.Y.Z_YY-MM-DD__HH.MM.SS.ext)
*_v[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*_[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]__*
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
~$*
